{
    "title": "Tracky : Location GPS Sharing",
    "description": "Welcome to Tracky, the ultimate family GPS tracking app that keeps your loved ones close and secure no matter the distance.\r\n\r\nKey Features of Tracky:\r\n\r\nRealtime Location Sharing : Find your friends location with realtime.\r\nDestination Notifications: Receive instant alerts when your tracked family members reach their destinations.\r\nFamily Map with GPS: Share real-time GPS locations with your family on an interactive map.\r\nPrivate Family Groups: Create exclusive private groups for your inner circle.\r\nSafe Zones with GPS: Set up safe zones using GPS, including home and other custom areas.\r\nUnlock the Full Potential of Tracky:\r\n\r\nLocation History: Dive into location histories to review past travels.\r\nProgress Tracking: Stay updated on family members' safe journeys through location sharing.\r\nPhone Tracking via GPS: Leverage GPS technology to track cell phones for added security.\r\nLost Phone Recovery: Quickly locate your lost or stolen phone using Tracky's location tracker.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Tracky for Your Family?\r\n\r\nSeamless Connectivity: Stay linked even during busy schedules with our family GPS locator.\r\nShare Your Whereabouts: Check in to share your location and reassure your family.\r\nPhone Finder: Gain peace of mind knowing you can find your misplaced phone effortlessly.\r\n\r\nOptional Permissions:\r\n\u2022 Location Services: Keep your family informed about your current location.\r\n\u2022 Notifications: Receive updates on family members' location changes.\r\n\u2022 Contacts: Find and invite other users to join your circle.\r\n\r\n\r\nRemember, At Tracky, we prioritize your family's privacy, allowing you to share your phone's location exclusively with trusted individuals.\r\n\r\nElevate your family's safety and stay connected like never before with Tracky. Download the app now on the Google Play Store and experience true peace of mind.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Tracky, the ultimate family GPS tracking app that keeps your loved ones close and secure no matter the distance.<br><br>Key Features of Tracky:<br><br>Realtime Location Sharing : Find your friends location with realtime.<br>Destination Notifications: Receive instant alerts when your tracked family members reach their destinations.<br>Family Map with GPS: Share real-time GPS locations with your family on an interactive map.<br>Private Family Groups: Create exclusive private groups for your inner circle.<br>Safe Zones with GPS: Set up safe zones using GPS, including home and other custom areas.<br>Unlock the Full Potential of Tracky:<br><br>Location History: Dive into location histories to review past travels.<br>Progress Tracking: Stay updated on family members&#39; safe journeys through location sharing.<br>Phone Tracking via GPS: Leverage GPS technology to track cell phones for added security.<br>Lost Phone Recovery: Quickly locate your lost or stolen phone using Tracky&#39;s location tracker.<br><br>Why Choose Tracky for Your Family?<br><br>Seamless Connectivity: Stay linked even during busy schedules with our family GPS locator.<br>Share Your Whereabouts: Check in to share your location and reassure your family.<br>Phone Finder: Gain peace of mind knowing you can find your misplaced phone effortlessly.<br><br>Optional Permissions:<br>\u2022 Location Services: Keep your family informed about your current location.<br>\u2022 Notifications: Receive updates on family members&#39; location changes.<br>\u2022 Contacts: Find and invite other users to join your circle.<br><br><br>Remember, At Tracky, we prioritize your family&#39;s privacy, allowing you to share your phone&#39;s location exclusively with trusted individuals.<br><br>Elevate your family&#39;s safety and stay connected like never before with Tracky. Download the app now on the Google Play Store and experience true peace of mind.",
